      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Say hey, so you're gonna use that\n<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Dream Egg <C:0000,0003,000000FF>to hide Peach, am I right?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Sure, sure. Well, be careful toting it.\nYou don't want it to break on the way!<C:0003,0001,>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Say hey, so you're gonna use that\n<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Dream Egg <C:0000,0003,000000FF>to hide Peach, am I right?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Sure, sure. Well, be careful toting it.\nYou don't want it to break on the way!<C:0003,0001,>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Say hey, so you're gonna use that\n<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Dream Egg <C:0000,0003,000000FF>to hide Peach, am I right?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Sure, sure. Well, be careful toting it.\nYou don't want it to break on the way!<C:0003,0001,>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "19": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>I'm sure you'll be fine, of course...\nYou're on an errand for a royal lady!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>I'm sure you'll be fine, of course...\nYou're on an errand for a royal lady!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>I'm sure you'll be fine, of course...\nYou're on an errand for a royal lady!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>I'm sure you'll be fine, of course...\nYou're on an errand for a royal lady!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "20": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Boy, ladies, am I right?<C:0003,0000,0A00> All of 'em \ndeserve that royal treatment, y'know?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Take my wife. When I proposed, I gave\nher a mobile and sent a text that said...<C:0003,0001,>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Boy, ladies, am I right?<C:0003,0000,0A00> All of 'em \ndeserve that royal treatment, y'know?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Take my wife. When I proposed, I gave\nher a mobile and sent a text that said...<C:0003,0001,>",
