      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>Boy, ladies, am I right?<C:0003,0000,0A00> All of 'em \ndeserve that royal treatment, y'know?<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Take my wife. When I proposed, I gave\nher a mobile and sent a text that said...<C:0003,0001,>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
    },
    "21": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0002,9600><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>RING ME 4 A RING RING!<C:0003,0000,0A00><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,9600><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>RING ME 4 A RING RING!<C:0003,0000,0A00><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0002,9600><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>RING ME 4 A RING RING!<C:0003,0000,0A00><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,9600><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>RING ME 4 A RING RING!<C:0003,0000,0A00><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
