    "24": {
      "text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>No? Nothing? You guys need to loosen up.\nYou're in a dream world. Live a little!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>No? Nothing? You guys need to loosen up.\nYou're in a dream world. Live a little!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>No? Nothing? You guys need to loosen up.\nYou're in a dream world. Live a little!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>No? Nothing? You guys need to loosen up.\nYou're in a dream world. Live a little!<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0002,6400>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
