      "original_tokenized_text": "<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0001,0004,>Now we have all three\n<C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Dream Eggs<C:0000,0003,000000FF>!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>Let's return to the dream\nworld where Peach awaits.<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0003,000000FF>",
